@startuml SABER Client Architecture

!theme plain
title Security Agent Benchmarking System - Generic Client Architecture

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor lightgreen
    BorderColor black
    ArrowColor black
    FontSize 10
}

package "Test Harness Core" {

    class TestHarness {
        +config: TestHarnessConfig
        +server_client: ServerClient
        +agent: Any
        +session_id: str?
        --
        +initialize(agent: Any): void
        +run_test(): Dict[str, Any]
        +shutdown(): void
    }

    class TestHarnessConfig {
        +server_url: str
        +log_level: str
        +log_file: Path?
        +agent_config: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        +validate(): void
    }
}

package "Server Communication" {

    class ServerClient {
        +rest_api_url: str
        +mcp_api_url: str
        +session_id: str?
        +timeout: float
        +mcp_client: MCPClient?
        --
        +create_session(client_id: str): str
        +close_session(): void
        +start_benchmark(task_ids: List[str], episode_attempts: int): BenchmarkInfo
        +get_current_task(): TaskInfo
        +get_policy(): PolicyInfo
        +health_check(): Dict[str, Any]
        +list_tasks(): List[TaskInfo]
        +connect_mcp(): void
        +disconnect_mcp(): void
        +list_tools(): List[MCPTool]
        +call_tool(name: str, args: Dict): MCPResult
    }

    class MCPClient {
        +mcp_url: str
        +session_context: Dict[str, str]
        --
        +connect(): void
        +disconnect(): void
        +list_tools(): List[MCPTool]
        +call_tool(): MCPResult
    }
}

package "Agent Adaptation" {

    class AgentWrapper {
        +agent: Any
        +process_method: Callable
        +reset_method: Callable?
        +is_async: bool
        --
        +process_prompt(prompt: str): str
        +reset(): void
        +_detect_process_method(): Callable
        +_detect_reset_method(): Callable?
    }

    class AgentLoader {
        --
        +load_from_path(path: str, class?: str): AgentWrapper
        +load_from_module(module: str, class?: str): AgentWrapper
        +_extract_agent_from_module(): Any
    }

    class PromptBuilder {
        --
        +build_initial_prompt(): str
        +build_step_prompt(): str
        +build_error_prompt(): str
        +build_completion_prompt(): str
    }
}

package "CLI Interface" {

    class CLI {
        --
        +main(): void
        +run_saber_client(): void
    }
}

' Relationships
TestHarness *-- TestHarnessConfig
TestHarness *-- ServerClient
TestHarness ..> AgentWrapper : uses
ServerClient *-- MCPClient
AgentLoader ..> AgentWrapper : creates
CLI ..> AgentLoader : uses
CLI ..> TestHarness : uses

note top of TestHarness
**Zero-friction test orchestration**
Accepts any agent object with callable methods.
No interface requirements for customers.
end note

note top of AgentWrapper
**Generic agent adaptation**
Automatically detects and adapts to any agent:
- Sync/async methods
- Different method names (process, generate, respond, etc.)
- Different parameter names (prompt, input, message, etc.)
- Class or function-based agents
end note

note top of CLI
**Zero-code-change CLI**
python -m saber.client --agent <path> --task <id> --episodes <n>
Works with any existing agent code.
end note

note right of ServerClient
**Dual Protocol Communication**
- REST API for session, episode, and policy management
- MCP API for dynamic tool discovery and execution only
- Agents get tools via MCP API, everything else via REST API
- Clean separation of tool execution from session management
end note

@enduml
- No logging or evaluation
end note

note top of ServerClient
**Simple REST Client**
- Direct API communication
- Minimal error handling
- Server handles all logic
end note

note top of AgentUnderTest
**Agent Interface**
- Agent receives prompts
- Agent returns text responses
- No knowledge of framework
end note

@enduml
